      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "tok bilong Bilak i go long Bilam",
      "rationale": "Mesinja i karim tok bilong Bilak i go ating Bilam."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na ⟨em⟩ i salim ol mesinja i go long Bilam, pikinini bilong Beor, long Pethor, we i stap long wara, long graun bilong ol pikinini bilong lain bilong en, bilong kolim em, i tok olsem: Lukim, wanpela lain i kamap long Mitsrayim; lukim, ol i karamapim ⟨את⟩ ai bilong graun, na ol i sindaun klostu long mi na ai bilong ol i stap long mi.",
